<title>USA: Nynex global communications president to resign.</title>
<headline>Nynex global communications president to resign.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nynex Corp said its president of global communications and media, Richard Blackburn, will leave the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>He will leave after the close of the company's merger with Bell Atlantic Corp, which is expected to take place during the first quarter of 1997, Nynex said.</p>
<p>The company has not yet named a successor.</p>
